{"slug":"mission","base_version":0,"body":"A street food hub from people we know, not a supermarket — for neighbours, and the three growers we already buy from.

We already buy from three growers — Ana, Tomasz and the Ferreira family. The hub exists so the whole street can do the same without a supermarket in between, and so the growers see the money the same week.

It is a stall, then a hall, run by people who live here. Not a restaurant, not a marketplace app, not a brand’s community programme.","lines":[],"diff":"Written the day the space opened — Maya alone, in her own chat, from what she told the agent at creation.","heard":["cbcc4abf794a1a0bacaa5a68f317de40765fde5874a9e304cbd516ded93fc0e9","7b25f55ef55adc7ae44d199f63a47a4865234be35e8f4ed4fd0aa020bf4b4555","a9371354ed2650a42414ebea19ccf99164723ccd71bb2657c690d1cbb7ac533c"]}

